{"15d88ad6-19e7-48b6-b5db-8107fcccb220":{"id":"15d88ad6-19e7-48b6-b5db-8107fcccb220","title":"Master Villainess the Invincible!","altTitle":"I'm a Martial Art Villainess but I'm the Strongest!","description":"Seorang penulis novel romansa fantasi mengalami kecelakaan tabrak lari, tapi begitu sadar kembali, ia menyadari dirinya jadi Dang Haewon, pemeran pembantu dalam novel yang pernah ia baca. Namun, Dang Haewon adalah tokoh jahat dan kejam yang mencoba membunuh pemeran utama wanita demi mendapatkan pemeran utama pria hingga mengakibatkan dirinya terbunuh. Tidak mau nasibnya berakhir seperti itu, si penulis pun memanfaatkan semua informasi yang didapatkannya sewaktu membaca novel itu. Akankah dia berhasil mengubah nasibnya dan jadi tokoh terkuat di novel itu?\n\n---\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/52653435)\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%AC%B4%ED%98%91%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EC%9D%B8%EB%8D%B0-%EB%82%B4%EA%B0%80-%EC%A0%9C%EC%9D%BC-%EC%8E%84/2455), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56271898)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://tapas.io/series/master-villainess-the-invincible/info)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.podoteng.com/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E5%A5%B3%E4%BF%A0%E7%95%B6%E5%AE%B6/99)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Akulah-Antagonis-Terkuat-di-Martial-Art/166)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/62807)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B6%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%8A_%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%89%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%94/136)","year":2020,"status":"comp